  "about": "The announcer's lines (EH9, #225): one recording each, named by its voice-pack file stem (sf_video::announcer::AnnouncerLine::file_stem). `text` is what he says; `prompt` is what the voice is sent, here the text in capitals for emphasis without a delivery tag. Editing a prompt re-voices that line alone on the next run. docs/reference/voice-pipeline.md.",
